  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A mass of 4.0 kg moving with a velocity of 1.0 m s<sup>−1</sup> is acted on by a net force which varies with distance as shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the maximum speed of the mass?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{35}\"></span> m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">6 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{71}\"></span> m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">12 m s<sup>−1</sup></li></ol>"
